Options -MultiViews

# Genuine 404s (missing images/PDFs/assets) get the real prerendered
# NotFound page. Unknown top-level paths still fall through to index.html
# below (200) rather than a true 404 status — that's intentional: single
# segment paths double as legacy QR-code icon links (e.g. /003-seraphim),
# and only the app itself knows whether a given slug is a real icon.
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html

RewriteEngine On
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
RewriteRule ^ index.html [QSA,L]
